Recovery Ledger uses ThreeUI's design-token system and stylesheet, vendored
into src/vendor/ (threeui-styles.css, theme.ts) under the MIT terms above.

The npm package itself is no longer a runtime dependency. Its shader
backgrounds render inside a sandboxed iframe whose srcdoc loads Tailwind from
cdn.tailwindcss.com at runtime, which this dashboard cannot accept: it is
meant to run offline from a static dist/, and an iframe cannot be tinted,
blended, or driven by the page's own data. src/components/FleetField.tsx is a
three.js scene written for this project in its place.
